        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "23d715e2-c4e0-594b-a3cc-4af500c9df6b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aamir Khan, Nasir Hussain, Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar, Dharmendra, Zeenat Aman, Ajit Khan, Vijay Arora, Tariq Khan, Neetu Singh, Tahir Hussain\n- Works: Yaadon Ki Baaraat\n- Topics: Indian Hindi cinema, film debuts, awards\n\nFacts:\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat is a 1973 Indian Hindi film.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat was directed by Nasir Hussain.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat was written by Salim-Javed, the duo of Salim Khan and Javed Akhtar.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat starred Dharmendra, Zeenat Aman, Ajit Khan, Vijay Arora, Tariq Khan, Neetu Singh, and Aamir Khan.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat was the debut film of Tariq Khan, who was Nasir Hussain's nephew.\n- Yaadon Ki Baaraat was also the debut film of Aamir Khan, who appeared as a child actor.\n- Aamir Khan was born as Mohammed Aamir Hussain Khan on 14 March 1965.\n- Aamir Khan is an Indian film actor, director, and producer.\n- Aamir Khan later became one of India's biggest movie stars as an adult.\n- Aamir Khan has received four National Film Awards, eight Filmfare Awards, and an Academy Award nomination.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
